<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN SBB H1 96 PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN SBB H1 96 PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1996 earnings</p>
<p>(million Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			    17 vs 29.8</p>
<p>    Turnover				  10,858 vs 12,839</p>
<p>    Non-cons net			     105.9 vs 101.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian building group Societe Belge des Betons SA</p>
<p>said group net profit would be lower in 1996 than in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
